00:12:10.262 --> 00:12:13.265
So, so I felt like we need
more people to speak up,

00:12:13.265 --> 00:12:16.035 align:start size:97% position:3%
speak out so that
everybody feels comfortable

00:12:16.035 --> 00:12:19.271
