00:12:45.698 --> 00:12:47.533
- Yeah so it's funny,
the latest episode.

00:12:47.533 --> 00:12:49.502 align:start size:84% position:16%
So I do a pod with.
- Yeah.

00:12:49.502 --> 00:12:52.638 align:start position:0%
- The All-In Pod with three
