00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:43.856
who feel the way that we do,
that things have go too far.

00:13:43.856 --> 00:13:47.793
And I think part of it is also
that with Trump off the scene

00:13:47.793 --> 00:13:51.964
it does depressurize the
