00:13:51.964 --> 00:13:54.099
for you know, like some of the.

00:13:54.099 --> 00:13:56.235
One or two of the
guys on our pod,

00:13:56.235 --> 00:13:59.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would describe as having
TDS for sure you know?

00:13:59.572 --> 00:14:03.876
And now that he's, that
he's sort of cured of his

00:14:03.876 --> 00:14:05.945
Trump derangement
syndrome, he's,

00:14:05.945 --> 00:14:10.950
you know he's speaking out
about the DA in San Francisco

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:13.219
